# DSH skill migration manifest
#
# Format: <link-name> <TAB> <source-dir-relative-to-repo-root> <TAB> <set> <TAB> <catalog-name>
#   link-name    name of the symlink created under the DSH skill root. It equals the
#                source directory name so base-relative links inside references/
#                (e.g. ../aIk-coding-style/references/x.md) keep resolving.
#   catalog-name name DSH shows and routes by; it comes from `name:` in SKILL.md
#                and must be strictly kebab-case (^[a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)*$).
#   set          core -> installed by default; extra -> only with --set all
#
# The canonical skill files stay in aik-skills-lab/ (shared with Lingma/Qoder/
# Claude through junctions), so installs are symlinks to a single source of truth.
#
# Adapter applied during migration:
#   aIk-coding-style: frontmatter `name:` changed from `aIk-coding-style` to
#   `aik-coding-style` (DSH rejects uppercase in skill names). The directory and
#   the link keep the original name so existing relative links still resolve.
#   Additionally (user-approved), tools/apply-audit-fixes.mjs applied the audit's
#   source improvements: description rewrites for DSH routing, the 3
#   code-generating contradiction fixes, write-before-confirm gates, the
#   component location-chain rewrite, and skill-tester catalog opt-out.
#
# Skills deliberately NOT migrated:
#   ccgui-plugin-creator  - targets the CC GUI desktop app plugin SDK; DSH uses its
#                           own Cordis plugin system, so the instructions do not apply.
#   gitnexus-*            - depend on the GitNexus MCP server/tools, which are not
#                           configured in this DSH profile; see report/.
link-name	source	set	catalog-name
aIk-coding-style	aik-skills-lab/aIk-coding-style	core	aik-coding-style
requirement-engineering	aik-skills-lab/requirement-engineering	core	requirement-engineering
system-design	aik-skills-lab/system-design	core	system-design
code-implementation	aik-skills-lab/code-implementation	core	code-implementation
code-review	aik-skills-lab/code-review	core	code-review
testing	aik-skills-lab/testing	core	testing
devops	aik-skills-lab/devops	core	devops
handoff-bundle	aik-skills-lab/handoff-bundle	core	handoff-bundle
component-extract-rewrite	aik-skills-lab/component-extract-rewrite	extra	component-extract-rewrite
skill-tester	aik-skills-lab/skill-tester	extra	skill-tester
